{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55822","headline":"父子联韵诗 · 詹敦仁","name":"父子联韵诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜静月华明，（仁。\n）秋深露气清。\n（琲。\n）园林消溽暑，（仁。\n）山水送寒声。\n（琲。\n）菊富陶无酒，（仁。\n）蓴肥翰可羹。\n（琲。\n）人生贵自适，（仁。\n）世利不须营。\n（琲。\n）漫舞衣饶冷，（仁。\n）狂歌酒易倾。\n（琲。\n）欢酬儿与父，（仁。\n）今古梦还醒。\n（琲。\n）笑眼看毛凤，（仁。\n）长怀念鶺鴒。\n（琲。\n）干戈时已定，（仁。\n）款款话平生。\n（琲。\n）（均见《闽诗录乙集》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}